<title>NETHERLANDS: Oce raises dividend as net jumps 57 pct.</title>
<headline>Oce raises dividend as net jumps 57 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VENLO, Netherlands 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch photocopier maker Oce-van der Grinten NV said on Monday its 1995/96 net profit jumped 57 percent to 169.5 million guilders from 108.3 million.</p>
<p>The company said it planned to raise its dividend to 3.00 guilders per share from 2.50.</p>
</text>
